SUMMARY:Red Hot Chili Jam live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Red Hot Chili Jam is the newest\, but most jamming\, Red Hot Chili Peppers tribute band on the scene. \nFormed from a group of die-hard Chili Pepper fans who came together through Reddit\, RHCJ pays homage to their favorite band through music. With a passion for playing the deep tracks that most cover bands don’t touch\, RHCJ plays an eclectic setlist while staying faithful to the styles\, sounds\, and techniques of the band. The band focuses on the John Frusciante era albums but sprinkles in tracks from the early days and the in-between albums. (Just don’t ask their opinions about One Hot Minute as you might start an argument). \nP.S. No imitation costumes – or socks – on show here. Just music by fans\, for fans. \n$5 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
