SUMMARY:5th Annual Caribbean Fete at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Carnival season is upon us\, which means it’s time for the grand 5th annual Caribbean Fete from 1-10pm! Be sure to celebrate with us!\nThe fantastic Mesha Steele and her Riddim All Stars return to put on another memorable performance from 7-10pm! With her expertise in Reggae\, Calypso\, Soca\, and more\, no one in the crowd will be seated. There will be a $10 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nWe’ll also have our limbo contest held on our outdoor stage to see who can go down the lowest. There will be games like dominoes\, ludi\, and playing cards available for all as well. \nCaribbean food will be available for purchase as part of the festivities from 1-10pm. \nAt the center of it all will be our Caribbean-inspired drinks\, hard seltzer cocktails\, frozen slushies\, and diverse taplist! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
